button, the dropdown, another profile's reload, Private). Temporary code,
never committed to Detour/. Gated on DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR;
DETOUR_VERIFY_PHASE 1 (light, the whole flow, fresh data dir) or 2 (dark,
relaunch on phase 1's data: the title bar, the dropdown, Cmd+O, a Private
