to $DETOUR_VERIFY_DIR/downloads-<phase>, never ~/Downloads.

Real input: NSApp.postEvent keys and clicks (⌥⌘N, typing into the
launcher, the host click, typing into the page's field, Cmd+O, a posted
click on the Open in button and on the chevron, Down/Return/Escape inside
the dropdown's tracking loop, driven by timers in .common mode). New
Private Window is performed from its File menu item (a posted Shift-Cmd-N
matched nothing, or New Window). A test extension (tabs, storage,
<all_urls>) records tabs.onCreated/onRemoved/onDetached/onAttached/
onActivated and windows.onRemoved into storage, serialised through one
promise chain (concurrent get/set lost events in the first run).

